{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Kuṭivihārin (1st)","html":"<article id='thag1.56'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.56 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.56 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Chaṭṭhavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Six </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Kuṭivihārittheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Kuṭivihārin (1st) </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Ko kuṭikāyaṁ bhikkhu kuṭikāyaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“Who is in this hut?” “A monk is in this hut, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Vītarāgo susamāhitacitto; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>free of lust, his mind serene. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Evaṁ jānāhi āvuso, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Reverend, you should know this: </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Amoghā te kuṭikā katā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>your hut wasn’t built in vain.” </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Kuṭivihāritthero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
